    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356640/extras/00bc2f520f4bbfa77e1d201e7d605f92.avif?t=1739833381\" /></span><br>The game is still in development and is therefore subject to potential changes. <br>Feel free to follow us on our Discord server and add the game to your wishlist!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A night of nightmare</h2>Appearances is a single-player first-person horror and puzzle game where you play as little Suzy, who is being cared for by her babysitter in the family villa. In the middle of the night, you hear a strange, piercing sound that seems specifically designed to wake you up. Your first instinct is to find your babysitter, but the night can be terrifying for a child with a vivid imagination. The music box your grandmother made for you is the best source of comfort, but you'll soon discover that something supernatural is lurking nearby, and this music box serves a purpose beyond simply playing music. It's up to you to uncover your family's past and put an end to these nightmarish apparitions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356640/extras/3142b3d062d6b9d6053833b2ce6d64f8.poster.avif?t=1739833381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356640/extras/3142b3d062d6b9d6053833b2ce6d64f8.webm?t=1739833381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parallel worlds</h2>Evolve into a contemporary family villa and navigate your way through this labyrinth of hallways and rooms. Nevertheless, following a mysterious blessing, you may gain access to a parallel world inhabited by the entity that haunts you. A shift in ambiance and new pathways will become available to you. Seize these opportunities to escape and uncover additional secrets.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356640/extras/7de0bfae029c5e8c4f887fbc8f4d87cd.poster.avif?t=1739833381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356640/extras/7de0bfae029c5e8c4f887fbc8f4d87cd.webm?t=1739833381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Music box</h2>Your grandmother's music box, its music is the only way to pull you out of your nightmares. Use this music box to locate the entity following you during this eventful night, and don't get caught.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356640/extras/e32ca84cd17be497b6907c97997b83da.poster.avif?t=1739833381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356640/extras/e32ca84cd17be497b6907c97997b83da.webm?t=1739833381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hidden secrets</h2>Uncover your family's secrets and reveal the truth by solving puzzles. However, always remember that you are just a child relentlessly pursued by an entity you can't comprehend.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356640/extras/b53d8092b680457030f6cceb287b0204.poster.avif?t=1739833381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356640/extras/b53d8092b680457030f6cceb287b0204.webm?t=1739833381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Psychological Horror</h2>This game is inspired by masterpieces of cinematographic and video game horror but also escape games!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356640/extras/1734f808d29079c551dfbbb26ec5bcac.poster.avif?t=1739833381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356640/extras/1734f808d29079c551dfbbb26ec5bcac.webm?t=1739833381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356640/extras/00bc2f520f4bbfa77e1d201e7d605f92.avif?t=1739833381\" /></span><br>The game is still in development and is therefore subject to potential changes. <br>Feel free to follow us on our Discord server and add the game to your wishlist!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A night of nightmare</h2>Appearances is a single-player first-person horror and puzzle game where you play as little Suzy, who is being cared for by her babysitter in the family villa. In the middle of the night, you hear a strange, piercing sound that seems specifically designed to wake you up. Your first instinct is to find your babysitter, but the night can be terrifying for a child with a vivid imagination. The music box your grandmother made for you is the best source of comfort, but you'll soon discover that something supernatural is lurking nearby, and this music box serves a purpose beyond simply playing music. It's up to you to uncover your family's past and put an end to these nightmarish apparitions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356640/extras/3142b3d062d6b9d6053833b2ce6d64f8.poster.avif?t=1739833381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356640/extras/3142b3d062d6b9d6053833b2ce6d64f8.webm?t=1739833381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parallel worlds</h2>Evolve into a contemporary family villa and navigate your way through this labyrinth of hallways and rooms. Nevertheless, following a mysterious blessing, you may gain access to a parallel world inhabited by the entity that haunts you. A shift in ambiance and new pathways will become available to you. Seize these opportunities to escape and uncover additional secr